@startuml
title Private burn — CMTATAztec

skinparam sequenceMessageAlign left
skinparam maxMessageSize 250

actor "Burner\n(holds BURNER_ROLE)" as Burner
actor "Holder\n(`account`)" as Holder
box "Client side" #F4F8FC
participant "burn(account, amount, authwit_nonce)\nexternal private" as Priv
participant "PXE\n(holder's notes)" as PXE
end box
database "Public state" as PS
box "Sequencer — public" #FDF4F4
participant "_burn(caller, amount)\nexternal public, only_self" as Pub
end box
participant "Issuer" as Issuer

note over Burner, Holder
  A burn needs BOTH: BURNER_ROLE on the caller AND the holder's consent.
  Unlike Solidity CMTAT there is no forced burn — the issuer cannot
  spend another holder's notes, because that needs the owner's key.
  A holder cannot burn their own tokens without the role either.
end note

alt the holder burns their own tokens — they must ALSO hold BURNER_ROLE
  Holder -> Priv : burn(account = self, amount, authwit_nonce = 0)
else a burner acts on the holder's behalf
  Holder -> Burner : sign an authwit for this exact call
  Burner -> Priv : burn(account = holder, amount, authwit_nonce != 0)
  Priv -> Priv : validate the authwit, then nullify the nonce
end

Priv -> PS : read issuer_address
Priv -> PS : read is_frozen(account)
note right of Priv : fails with "Frozen: Sender" —\n`account` is the address being debited
Priv -> PS : operateOnBurn(account)\nblacklist or whitelist, whichever is enabled

Priv -> PXE : sub(amount) on `account`
PXE --> Priv : nullify the spent notes, create a change note
Priv -> Holder : change note, onchain_constrained
Priv -> Issuer : copy of the change note, offchain

Priv -> Pub : enqueue_self _burn(msg_sender(), amount)
note over Pub
  What becomes public: the caller's address and the amount.
  The caller always holds BURNER_ROLE, and the role table is
  public anyway — so this reveals which role-holder acted,
  not which holder was debited. `account` never crosses over.
end note
Pub -> PS : only_role(BURNER_ROLE, caller)
Pub -> PS : assert not deactivated\n(a pause does not stop a burn, as in CMTAT)
Pub -> PS : total_supply -= amount

@enduml
